  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\left.\\text { adj( } Q^{-1} B P^{-1}\\right) \\\\ & =\\left|Q^{-1} B P^{-1}\\right|\\left(Q^{-1} B P^{-1}\\right)^{-1} \\\\ & =\\left|Q^{-1}\\right||B|\\left|P^{-1}\\right| PB^{-1} Q \\\\ & =|B| P \\frac{(\\operatorname{adj} \\mathrm{~B})}{|B|} Q \\\\ & =\\text { PAQ }\\end{aligned}$"
  }
